---
// The brand mark — the ASCII banner from the top of the repo's README,
// set in terminal green. Rendered as an image for assistive tech.
interface Props {
  size?: number; // font-size in px
  glow?: boolean;
  class?: string;
}
const { size = 12, glow = true, class: cls = '' } = Astro.props;
---

<pre
  class:list={['ascii', cls, { noglow: !glow }]}
  style={`font-size:${size}px`}
  role="img"
  aria-label="ORPHUS — ASCII block-letter wordmark">
 ██████╗ ██████╗ ██████╗ ██╗  ██╗██╗   ██╗███████╗
██╔═══██╗██╔══██╗██╔══██╗██║  ██║██║   ██║██╔════╝
██║   ██║██████╔╝██████╔╝███████║██║   ██║███████╗
██║   ██║██╔══██╗██╔═══╝ ██╔══██║██║   ██║╚════██║
╚██████╔╝██║  ██║██║     ██║  ██║╚██████╔╝███████║
 ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝     ╚═╝  ╚═╝ ╚═════╝ ╚══════╝</pre>

<style>
  .noglow { text-shadow: none; }
</style>
